  | 415 | Type not allowed | `File 'X' has an unsupported type. Allowed types: PDF, DOCX, XLSX, ODT, TXT, JPEG, PNG, GIF, WEBP, HEIC, TIFF.` |
  | 415 | Content does not match extension | `The content of file 'X' is a PNG file, which does not match its extension '.pdf'.` |
