  5. **Restoring a credit of an archived client** is allowed, and the credit stays INACTIVE.
  6. **Extra input limits.** Beyond the specified limits, I added `@Digits` limits (amount and collateral value up to 13 integer digits and 2 decimals, rate up to 3 integer digits and 4 decimals) so values fit the NUMERIC columns. Rate 0 is allowed.
